    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d142-f1" n="20" xml:id="d142-f1-content">
                <p>The original bears the notation: “Not acknowledged. Copy and enclosures sent to
                    Gen. Bliss Jan. 9–19.”</p>
                <p>The enclosures filed in the papers of General Bliss bear the additional notation:
                    “Turned over to General Bliss with Navy plan of occupation of Fiume Jan. 22,
                    with French originals and unsent letter expressing Sect, views to Pres.
                    Wilson.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
